  "question": {
    "text": "A body of mass <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>kg</mi></math> rests on a horizontal floor with which it has a coefficient of static friction <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mfrac></math>. It is desired to make the body move by applying the minimum possible force <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>F</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi></math>. The value of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>F</mi></math> will be _______.(Round off to the Nearest Integer) [Take <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>g</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn><msup><mrow><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math> ]",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "5",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/74ce1095-9baa-4ab6-9ba8-53ccf3652cb5-image.png\" style=\"width: 242px; height: 160px;\" /></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>F</mi><mi>cos</mi><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>&#956;</mi><mi>N</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>F</mi><mi>sin</mi><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>N</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>m</mi><mi>g</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>F</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>&#956;</mi><mi>mg</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>cos</mi><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>&#956;</mi><mi>sin</mi><mi>&#952;</mi></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>F</mi><mi>min</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>&#956;</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>g</mi></mrow><msqrt><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>&#956;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></msqrt></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mfrac><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>10</mn></mrow><mfrac><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mfrac></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn></math></p>",
